description:
Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Create an 8-bit up/down counter with enable and reset functionality. The counter counts up when the direction signal is high and counts down when it is low. The counter resets to 0 when the reset signal is high.

// Signals are defined as below:
// (1) reset: Resets the counter to 0. Active high.
