Design a circuit that detects edges in an 8-bit input signal. The module captures the input state on the rising edge of the clock and compares it with the previous state to identify changes. The output, `anyedge`, indicates which bits have changed by using the XOR operation, effectively marking any transitions (edges) from the previous to the current input value.
